# Phase 2 research pipeline — code (.py) and docs (.md) are always versioned.
# Only large/regenerable/secret files are excluded below. Never add a bare
# "*.py" or "research/" pattern here -- that would silently hide code from
# Cowork's audit, which is exactly the failure this comment exists to prevent.
research/data/
research/.marathon.lock
research/marathon_cycle.log
*.parquet
*.db
fred_key.txt
.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc
